{
  "richContent": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "1rbhq1",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Now, would it be all right if we took a short fall break?",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "7i4ia3",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "lwah84",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "I come before you today with a confession.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "kxtdn6",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "8imwn7",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "I\u2019m happy.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "4vbuo9",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "1w62r10",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "About Gator football, no less.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "v77sf12",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "oyzu813",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Please don\u2019t call anybody.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "kskhg15",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "vh7a016",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "No intervention is necessary. And don\u2019t mistake this for a declaration that Florida has solved every problem between the offensive line and the parking lot.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "2bqv618",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "dcbaf19",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "I\u2019m simply enjoying what I\u2019m seeing. A football team learning to punch back. A coach giving it a reason to believe. And a fan base that deserves something more rewarding for its investment than another explanation of why everybody needs to remain patient.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "m1p8r21",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "k6mlj22",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Patience is a fine virtue. But after a while, you\u2019d like it to produce a first down.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "8j5hn24",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "lbslr25",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Now comes an open date, arriving like a screen porch and a comfortable chair.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "eaqm127",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "or4h328",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Would it be all right if we sat down for a minute?",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "6yf1730",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "vi3a531",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Not quit. Not lose interest. Just take a breath in this beautiful fall weather and remember that watching sports is supposed to be fun, too.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "xxwy433",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "zow5034",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "I\u2019m preparing for a much-needed three-day trip to Northwest Florida to see a loved one. Along the way, I intend to watch a little baseball, enjoy those remarkable Tampa Bay Rays and let somebody else worry about what it all means.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "nnqut36",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "b1j5o37",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "For a quick second, I\u2019d like to be a spectator.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "csssc39",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "mrm3t40",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "A fellow watching the game instead of mentally writing the third paragraph during a pitching change.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "p7fc942",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "5qbzj43",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "There\u2019s Gator basketball to enjoy, too. And no, I don\u2019t intend to turn an exhibition loss to Baylor into a congressional investigation.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "d6rom45",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "yop9546",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "But before I step away, a thank-you is in order.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "5na5p48",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "y3ney49",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "To the Gator fans.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "mcs5d51",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "giw1u52",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "For the juice. For the loyalty. For continuing to show up when showing up required considerably more faith than the preseason brochure suggested.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "a6dti54",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "zc85655",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Those folks put down their hard-earned money, fill the Swamp and keep caring through seasons when the return on investment wouldn\u2019t get past the first meeting at the bank.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "3j40n57",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "llwty58",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "They remind me of that old Timex commercial: \u201cTake a lickin\u2019 and keeps on tickin\u2019.\u201d",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "d71ap60",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "ccxj861",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Although I suspect a few of them would appreciate a Saturday when nobody has to test the warranty.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "2q9oe63",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "vlewg64",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "We in the press box sometimes perform a little balancing act with that word \u201cfan.\u201d We\u2019re supposed to observe, evaluate and tell the truth, not lead cheers with a laptop.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "b0sa766",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "41ife67",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Fair enough.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "5sl8t69",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "h3iep70",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "But you can recognize loyalty without surrendering your credentials. And you can appreciate what these people bring without pretending you haven\u2019t noticed what they\u2019ve endured.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "pawmu72",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "g8wgm73",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Jon Sumrall noticed. He said the passion surrounding Florida helped attract him here.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "65pwc75",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "l07wi76",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Now we\u2019re beginning to see what happens when his team borrows some of it.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "3fzvw78",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "53bq779",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Down 7\u20133 at Texas, with untested backup quarterback Tramell Jones Jr. at the controls, Florida had an opportunity to follow a familiar and thoroughly unpleasant script.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "yi3iq81",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "uw2mp82",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Instead, the Gators changed the ending.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "xzeqr84",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "743rz85",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Jones helped give them a chance. A tweaked defense finally got off the field on those aggravating third downs. And when Texas threw a punch, Florida did something its coaches had been asking it to do.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "qxx0987",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "c4e3c88",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "It punched back.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "h02ey90",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "s8mm991",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "On the Longhorns\u2019 own grass.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "ul94m93",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "hkz5d94",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "That\u2019s a satisfying place to hold a Texas roadside barbecue.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "prt7v96",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "0lqg097",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "It brought to mind something Steve Spurrier often told his struggling teams: \u201cJust keep playing hard \u2026 and something good will happen.\u201d",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "qui2l99",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "ycpta100",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Simple advice. No consultant required.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "wchnh102",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "s0ese103",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "And frequently, something good did happen.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "2od9b105",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "v3jy1106",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Think about where Florida stands now: two victories over top-seven teams and one win away from bowl eligibility.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "svivu108",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "yn737109",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "I realize \u201cbowl eligible\u201d isn\u2019t a phrase that sets off fireworks around here. This is Florida. The historical ambition involves considerably more than securing an extra practice schedule and a December itinerary.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "o5yj7111",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "a1pdr112",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Still, there\u2019s a difference between acknowledging progress and lowering the ceiling.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "93ccr114",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "miuea115",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "You can enjoy climbing a few steps without declaring you\u2019ve reached the penthouse.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "a5trq117",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "jmcay118",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "And suddenly, that next daunting assignment looks a little different.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "tj2pg120",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "s8nk2121",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "What once might have felt like an opt-out has become an opportunity.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "1wa2c123",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "xadfv124",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Please don\u2019t get me started on comparative scores. That road usually ends with a man explaining on a napkin why his team should be national champion.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "q5ijb126",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "5nxrf127",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "But wasn\u2019t that Auburn team that beat Georgia the same Auburn team Florida defeated?",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "k6opf129",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "cfpi6130",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Just asking. Leaving the napkin in my pocket.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "8ggou132",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "qrpz1133",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "On a weekend when SEC giants fell like redwoods, a little daylight appeared where Florida\u2019s path had looked awfully shaded.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "tz9db135",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "fvx36136",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "There\u2019s still plenty to sort out over these last six games. I had this pegged as a 6\u20136 season, and these Gators are giving me reason to reconsider.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "kb3ek138",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "jjmsx139",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Being wrong has never frightened me much. In this business, you learn to leave room for it in the overhead compartment.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "uprrz141",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "g6ktr142",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Especially when being wrong might turn out to be this enjoyable.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "vn9gq144",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "2688b145",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "So I\u2019m going to savor Austin, thank the people who never stopped caring and take my little fall respite.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "1cqi6147",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "ng8ng148",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "And now for the weekend:",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "4yyf8150",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "brabr151",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "A loved one. Some baseball. A little basketball. A few hours without treating every scoreboard as a personal medical report.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "a9i14153",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "rm59p154",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Then I\u2019ll be back for the football.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "wjymo156",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "epsjc157",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Happily.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "kkdjw159",
        "nodes": [],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
