  "excerpt": "Now, would it be all right if we took a short fall break? I come before you today with a confession. I\u2019m happy. About Gator football, no less. Please don\u2019t call anybody. No intervention is necessary. And don\u2019t mistake this for a declaration that Florida has solved every problem between the offensive line and the parking lot. I\u2019m simply enjoying what I\u2019m seeing. A football team learning to punch back. A coach giving it a reason to believe. And a fan base that deserves something more rewarding...",
